        "message": "[Doc] Fix the docs build: code span for a docstring index expression\n\nmkdocs (--strict) read \"[rank][token / splits][row]\" in the\nQkvFrontKernel.send docstring as a Markdown reference link and aborted on\nthe unresolved target 'token / splits'. Put the expression in a code span.\n\nSigned-off-by: Duncan Moss <dmoss@nvidia.com>"
      },
